WEBVTT

00:02:58.578 --> 00:03:00.906
acts like a 3D pixel in our space,

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:03.810
which means that both computers and people

00:03:03.834 --> 00:03:05.708
can move this object to anywhere

00:03:05.732 --> 00:03:07.677
within this little 3D space.

00:03:07.701 --> 00:03:11.169
What we did was essentially
canceling gravity

00:03:11.193 --> 00:03:13.308
and controlling the movement by combining

00:03:13.332 --> 00:03:16.132
magnetic levitation
and mechanical actuation

00:03:16.156 --> 00:03:18.609
and sensing technologies.

00:03:18.633 --> 00:03:21.114
And by digitally programming the object,

00:03:21.138 --> 00:03:23.891
we are liberating
the object from constraints

00:03:23.915 --> 00:03:27.326
of time and space, which means that now,

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:31.222
human motions can be
recorded and played back